 "text": "Hi, how you doing these days? Once upon a twilight midnight camp at the base of a giant mountain, where the old legend said the ghost of lost climber haunted. The campfire glowed softly, casting shadows that made the dark corners of the dormitory seem even darker. The wind moaned through the trees, and the stars above were just pinpoints of light, half hidden by the earth. Maybe read to her first light, and start with something cheerful. The old washroom in the school hall never failed to put a fear So, a big scary looking rock fall down the trail. They decided to switch places and take turns keeping watch, each one half an hour.",
